<section class="support-impact" aria-labelledby="impact-title" data-support-impact>
  <div class="impact-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">Scale & impact</p><h2 id="impact-title">Real conversations.<br/>Clear assumptions.</h2></div><p>The platform handles approximately <strong>40,000 conversations per month</strong> across support areas. A September 2026 TAC sample gives a useful starting point for understanding how AI assistance and human support share that work.</p></div>
  <div class="observed-metrics"><div><strong>79.5%</strong><span>Without a human agent</span><small>TAC sample · includes customer-ended chats.<br/>Not a verified resolution rate.</small></div><div><strong>20.5%</strong><span>Human-agent handover share</span><small>Agent-ended chats in the TAC sample</small></div><div><strong>500k/day</strong><span>Queries · up to</span><small>Owner-reported design capacity</small></div></div>
  <div class="impact-calculator"><div class="volume-control"><p class="estimate-label">Explore the projection</p><label for="support-volume">Monthly conversations <output for="support-volume" data-volume>40,000</output></label><input type="range" id="support-volume" min="10000" max="80000" step="1000" value="40000" aria-describedby="estimate-method"/><div class="range-labels"><span>10,000</span><span>80,000</span></div><p>Move the slider to estimate the monthly split at the same TAC sample rate.</p></div><div class="projected-results"><div class="result-bar" role="img" aria-label="Projected split: 79.5 percent without an agent, 20.5 percent human handovers"><span></span><span></span></div><dl><div><dt><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Without an agent · estimate</dt><dd data-without>≈31,800</dd></div><div><dt><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Human handovers · estimate</dt><dd data-handovers>≈8,200</dd></div></dl><p class="projection-status" aria-live="polite" data-projection-status>At 40,000 monthly conversations: approximately 8,200 human handovers.</p></div></div>
  <p class="impact-method" id="estimate-method"><strong>How to read this:</strong> The monthly volume is owner-reported. The rates come from a TAC-only sample classified by the final message sender. “Without an agent” includes both bot-ended and customer-ended conversations; it is not a verified resolution rate. Applying TAC’s 20.5% handover share across all departments is an estimate; the actual mix may differ. Figures are rounded. Internal report details and customer data are omitted.</p>
</section>
